  "nonNavigableContext": "The central glass fabrication exhibit is protected equipment. Surrounding lawns, planted beds, pools, distant rooftops and separate campus buildings are scenic context. Full cross-plan laboratory circulation, north approach, south garden plaza and side cross-paths are authored traversable floor.",
  "lessons": [
    "A glass-bounded central chip exhibit creates a true circulation ring and separate technical teaching wings.",
    "Native-scale inspection chairs are separate from the original full-scene artwork.",
    "Whole-scene floor review includes the north entry and complete south fountain loop instead of accepting only a center-route mask.",
    "Art repair removed a narrow electronics rack that pinched the east circulation and shortened fountain/hedges to create a real broad southern cross-path, rather than declaring those visible floor strips nonnavigable.",
    "Independent visual audit identified real inter-table and rear-wall floors masked by mixed cells. A bounded original-art edit widened the actual passages and removed wall cabinets, then the complete floor was reauthored.",
    "Independent review caught real prop feet outside area-threshold collision cells. Protected every intersected prop cell explicitly and preserved wide actual surrounding floor routes; no engine change."
  ]
